  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">事業活動を営む上で必要な安定的資金調達等の維持・強化</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
